# AI sport-edit guard

## Default

Every sport picks/results/chart surface is **locked**. Do not edit a sport the
owner did not name in **this** message.

## When the owner asks

Owner ask = unlocked for **only** what they named (sport + miss). Do not ask
for the UNLOCK phrase. Do not touch other sports, chrome, paywall, or shared
branches “while you are here.”

## One surface

- One named sport (or chrome/surface) per miss.
- A checker fail, hang, or blank page on sport A is **not** an unlock for sport B.
- Do not edit locked-sport branches inside `NHL77FINAL.py`,
  `team_results_charts.py`, or sport-named modules for a sport that was not named.

## Session sticky (recommended)

When unlocked, keep a one-line note of the open surface (sport + miss). When
the miss is done, treat that sport as locked again the same day. Do not leave
a sport open overnight.

## Props / chrome / account

PROPS, HEADER, FOOTER, HAMBURGER, paywall, account, and Google tag stay locked
unless the owner names that surface in the same message.

## If unclear

Stop and ask which sport/surface to edit. Do not guess and switch tasks.
